{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>第63屆金馬獎頒獎典禮今（22）晚圓滿結束，港產片大豐收，奪得幾個大獎，包括最佳劇情片《善男信女》，該片同時奪得最佳原著劇本（楊兩全﹑火車）；金馬影后則由《第四幕》袁澧林獲奬，MIRROR的江𤒹生憑《我們不是什麼》首膺最佳男配角，最佳劇情短片及最佳紀錄片都由香港導演奪得。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:43:59.516981+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T01:57:27.788184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:28.610100+00:00","content_hash":"ae46daf8aa88ae8cd2007d6cd24ea82b10ed141b2afc045626e628a7fc2d292f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}